{"candidateAnswer":"Last summer 2023","evidence":"[D26:23 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] John: Organizing a basketball camp for kids in my hometown last summer was an awesome experience! Seeing their faces light up when they hit the court was priceless. It was a week full of laughs, high-fives, and personal growth for us all. That opportunity to inspire those kids and show them just how much potential they have was truly incredible.","itemId":"urn:uuid:db268d4c-9602-5748-9138-4b57e974fa0e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ed3a99d48c2497e06043fcd1170f7242cdaf3f9f37692ed07f28a2a71f3c639a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John organize a basketball camp for kids?","referenceAnswer":"summer 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ed3a99d48c2497e06043fcd1170f7242cdaf3f9f37692ed07f28a2a71f3c639a"}}]}